{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And you shall remove the evil from your midst, and all Israel</b> — and adjacent to it: 'And if there be in a man a sin.' This teaches that all Israel are guarantors for one another to remove and to rebuke sinners. Above it is written 'and they shall stone him,' and adjacent to it is the section of hanging. This teaches that all who are stoned are hanged."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:11.855624066Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}